["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Underwriting Superintelligence: Backing Agents you can Sue — Rune Kvist, AIUC AIUC-1 eval awareness groundedness filter lemon problem CAISI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-latentspace-ai-落地的瓶颈不是能力-是没人敢签字担责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6979f3df4fdf5281-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 落地的瓶颈不是能力，是没人敢签字担责</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 四年前就比人开得好，却至今进不了机场——约束 AI 有用性的从来不是能力，而是责任、风险和信任。AIUC 想用标准加保险补上这块信心基础设施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 合规</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 保险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transplanted human brain-tissue takes root in mice without a cortex organoid pallium xenocortical mice paper to agent AlphaGenome\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-naturepod-人脑类器官移植进小鼠-长出了四百万人类神经元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">28:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>人脑类器官移植进小鼠，长出了四百万人类神经元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鼠被基因手段删掉几乎整个皮层，植入人脑类器官后长出约400万人类神经元，行为既不像正常鼠也不像无皮层鼠，而是第三种状态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">类器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"For Want of a Resistor clock buffer HCSL probe effect 0201 stencil\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-oxideandfriend-一颗三美元的时钟缓冲器-差点让整家计算机公司停摆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://img.transistorcdn.com/TmRCVKlYs2wYJhxA4OEP-faXG_11cViDraGiqwLG2Co/rs:fill:0:0:1/w:1400/h:1400/q:60/mb:500000/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWct/dXBsb2FkLXByb2R1/Y3Rpb24udHJhbnNp/c3Rvci5mbS84Mjlh/MDlmOTIwZDg5M2U5/NDcyOTIzYWUwNDAy/N2M4MS5wbmc.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>一颗三美元的时钟缓冲器，差点让整家计算机公司停摆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 需求爆发后，第九代 PCIe 时钟缓冲器被扫空，替代品又踩中 HCSL 端接的隐蔽差异。最后救回产线的不是芯片，是一颗 0201 电阻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件供应链</span><span class=\"tag\">PCIe</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Beyond the Hype: Dr. Xiao Liu on Evaluating Medical AI Delphi study CONSORT SPIRIT white dot syndromes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-nejmaigrandrou-ai-评估的混乱不是技术问题-是透明度问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">43:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 评估的混乱不是技术问题，是透明度问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那篇系统综述里，只有不到 5% 的医学影像 AI 论文达到了其他医学领域早已确立的严谨标准，而表现最好的模型也只是与放射科医生持平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">临床验证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Coley&#x27;s Toxins and the Origins of Immunotherapy erysipelas Bacillus prodigiosus BCG tumor necrosis factor (TNF)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-stuffmissed-他用细菌毒素治癌症-被同行骂了四十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>他用细菌毒素治癌症，被同行骂了四十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coley 用链球菌毒素让部分肉瘤患者肿瘤消失，但无法标准化、无法解释机制，最终被放疗和监管挤出局；他的女儿用后半生为这套疗法建起了癌症研究所。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">癌症免疫治疗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ron Rothblum on Fiat-Shamir Attacks, Flock and SNARK.fast Fiat-Shamir GKR diagonalization polynomial commitment scheme sketched code binary fields\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-zeroknowledge-fiat-shamir-攻击不是误用-是协议本身不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Fiat-Shamir 攻击不是误用，是协议本身不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GKR 这类真实部署的协议，在标准 Fiat-Shamir 下可被证明假命题为真；这不是实现疏忽，是变换本身的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零知识证明</span><span class=\"tag\">Fiat-Shamir</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Annie Lowrey on the Time Tax, Fraud, and Rationing by Paperwork time tax TANF submerged benefits Jevons paradox improper payment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-tyler-政府不只浪费你的钱-还浪费你每周一小时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0fc39ddaf6ffc3b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>政府不只浪费你的钱，还浪费你每周一小时</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国人不自己报税的国家有一堆，IRS 却被法律禁止替你做。时间税最狠的不是富人，是穷人、移民和进过监狱的人——而 AI 未必救得了他们。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span><span class=\"tag\">行政负担</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The AI-Native CRM business world model greenfield / brownfield schema hopium ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-a16z-tome-做到-2500-万用户后-他推倒重来去做-crm/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Tome 做到 2500 万用户后，他推倒重来去做 CRM</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Keith Perez 放弃 2500 万用户的 Tome，因为团队自己都不喜欢那个产品；他判断 CRM 的胜负手不是让销售多干活，而是能不能把公司的客户现实完整建模。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>16</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRM</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 原生应用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Are bad teeth the number one reason kids go to A&amp;E? NEET P-Doom dentine\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-moreorless-儿童看急诊第一原因是牙-数字被念错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>儿童看急诊第一原因是牙？数字被念错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国议员说牙齿问题是儿童进急诊的第一原因，实际数字指的是5到18岁因蛀牙住院治疗——两者不是一回事，而蛀牙率其实在缓慢下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">事实核查</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Michael Moritz - Lessons From 40 Years of Investing and Writing - [Invest Like the Best, EP.491] bolt hole monomania collabos great man theory Fleet Street\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ilt-红杉前掌门看人-14-岁前发生了什么-内核就定了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/099b44b457a7da61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>红杉前掌门看人：14 岁前发生了什么，内核就定了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他挖自己难民家族的历史后发现，一个人 12、13、14 岁前从父母身上无意识吸收的印记会跟你一辈子；之后变的是外在强度，不是内核。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投资</span><span class=\"tag\">红杉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Extreme Meteorology (EL NIÑO) with Marshall Shepherd ENSO teleconnection atmospheric rivers jet stream warm blob\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ologies-最强厄尔尼诺还没到峰值-但没人活着见过它这么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>最强厄尔尼诺还没到峰值，但没人活着见过它这么大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年的厄尔尼诺在秋季就已超过 1982 和 2015 两次历史最强事件的峰值，而它的峰值通常在冬季才到。这不是未来的气候预测，是正在发生的天气。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候</span><span class=\"tag\">厄尔尼诺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How investing is getting riskier (Two Indicators) margin trading margin call single-stock leveraged ETF prediction market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-planetmoney-保证金债务创纪录-散户正在用借来的钱炒股/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>保证金债务创纪录，散户正在用借来的钱炒股</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国券商保证金债务已超过全美信用卡债务总额，韩国杠杆 ETF 崩盘让 36 万个账户被强制清仓，其中多数是 35 岁以下的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保证金交易</span><span class=\"tag\">杠杆ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 031 - EMERGENCY EPISODE: Are We Doomed? | Jordan Nanos, Doug O&#x27;Laughlin, Max Kan, Joey Brookhart neocloud backwardation P Doom RSI ROSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-semianalysiswe-安全不是减速带-anthropic-的合规承诺反而要吃掉更多算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>安全不是减速带：Anthropic 的合规承诺反而要吃掉更多算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 的「pacing the frontier」被读成要少买卡，但 OpenAI 光思维链监控就花掉 20% 的算力——安全本身是算力密集型产业，需求继续跑赢供给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"88.在新加坡，与祥峰郑俊聪的访谈：硬科技，下一代 Long China 与华人创新的信心史 golden share DPI Singapore Washing eVTOL AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-lightstar-投中宇树却错过加注-耐心资本也会被基金周期卡住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccc5fa65423d3ede-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>投中宇树却错过加注：耐心资本也会被基金周期卡住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">祥峰2020年是宇树Pre-A+轮唯一机构投资人，2023年那轮却因自家美元基金到期、正在募新基金而没钱跟投。重仓追投考验的不只是眼光，还有基金和项目的节奏匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技投资</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How to Be a Double Unicorn, with John Urschel | Better in Person CTE NIL Cantor&#x27;s Diagonal argument uncountable\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-freakonomics-数学教授和nfl球员-他说自己只是运气好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31b59d596097facf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>数学教授和NFL球员，他说自己只是运气好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Urschel 一边打NFL一边读完MIT数学博士，却说天赋只占一小部分，自己成功靠的是「极其大量的苦功」和运气——他甚至希望橄榄球名声没帮他拿到MIT教职。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">职业选择</span><span class=\"tag\">数学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E251｜推理芯片之战：聊聊Groq、Cerebras与OpenAI三大路径与Bill Dally的设计哲学 arithmetic intensity roofline model MFU MBU Dark silicon Amdahl&#x27;s Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-sv101-推理芯片绕过cuda是必然-但sram的窗口未必一直开着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>推理芯片绕过CUDA是必然，但SRAM的窗口未必一直开着</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">训练拼算力、推理拼带宽，Groq和Cerebras都押SRAM，但一个为确定性打折、一个为良率打折；OpenAI却选了最贵的HBM4，因为它缺的是电不是钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">SRAM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Luke Harding and Alastair Campbell: Trump, Putin and the New Age of Conquest (Part Two) FSB crink axis of upheaval dictator envy AFD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-iq2-特朗普在莫斯科的档案-比任何政策分析都更能解释他的顺从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d96b3b64117a97e0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">36:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普在莫斯科的档案，比任何政策分析都更能解释他的顺从</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄罗斯情报机构对特朗普的监视从1970年代就开始了，FSB在丽思卡尔顿酒店24小时驻人。卢克·哈丁认为，这份档案是理解特朗普对普京态度的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">俄罗斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"JD Vance on AI, Entitlement Fraud, Iran War, Israel, H-1B Abuse &amp; the Midterms SNAP NIMBY DOGE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-前沿公司造了弗兰肯斯坦-却找政府要监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ff4664d500d34f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">27:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 前沿公司造了弗兰肯斯坦，却找政府要监管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">万斯说，如果你在造弗兰肯斯坦，第一该停下来，第二当企业来要防御工具时得给他们——而不是把前沿公司自己造的风险外包给全球治理机构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">H-1B</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Are Budget Airlines Facing Extinction? ULCC Basic Economy premiumization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-wsjournal-廉价航空的对手不是同行-是卖里程的信用卡生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">18:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>廉价航空的对手不是同行，是卖里程的信用卡生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">超低成本航空靠极致低价起家，如今被大航司的 Basic Economy 和常旅客信用卡夹击——后者让旅客愿意多花 100 美元只为攒积分，价格敏感型客户反而成了最不可靠的客户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空业</span><span class=\"tag\">商业模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Balance of AI Power: Anton Leicht on Politics, Pacing Deals, and Muddling Through Well compute for access quasi vassalage SRO surveillance maxing muddle through\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-cogrev-暂停前沿开发对中国是笔好交易-所以美国不会接受/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f309d831f20dfbd2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>暂停前沿开发对中国是笔好交易，所以美国不会接受</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果暂停只覆盖前沿模型开发、不覆盖机器人、电力、半导体国产化这些赛道，中国就能把其余全部跑完，再在失去芯片优势的时点重启竞赛——这笔交易对美国明显不利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>30</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Episode 199: Ken and Dawn respond to listener questions on aging, meat consumption and dementia, genetic testing, AI, exercise, a lunar mission and much more openweight APOE4 sarcopenia anabolic resistance bioelectrical impedance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-stemtalk-近前沿模型开源后-闭源实验室的护城河还剩什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/48692e1482a92168-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>近前沿模型开源后，闭源实验室的护城河还剩什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果中国开源模型几个月就能逼近美国闭源前沿，那么「我们模型最强」就不再是护城河，真正值钱的是生态、可靠性和工作流整合。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Satya Nadella on the AI Doomer Slowdown, Microsoft&#x27;s Master Plan &amp; Who Wins AI reward hacking capability overhang KV cache harness test time compute\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-微软不追前沿模型-纳德拉说真正的生意是当所有人的中间层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0dbdd0b5b0c7b4d6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>微软不追前沿模型：纳德拉说真正的生意是当所有人的中间层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿实验室在争谁造最强模型，纳德拉说微软要做的是让企业「用所有模型但独立于所有模型」——模型层的超额利润会被开源压掉，钱在应用和中间层。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Physical AI Learns Across Language, Video and Action — Ming-Yu Liu world model forward dynamics inverse dynamics sim-to-real gap embodiment temporal position embedding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-mlst-世界模型不是预测未来-是给机器人做排名验证/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e10a54548d7f7f00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是预测未来，是给机器人做排名验证</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cosmos 3 把前向动力学、逆向动力学和策略塞进一个模型，但最先落地的不是训练，而是用神经模拟器给一堆 checkpoint 排名，筛掉大部分再上真机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Dark Matter Has a Problem. So Does MOND. MOND asymmetric drift external field effect baryonic mass kiloparsec\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-intotheimpossi-银河系外缘转慢了-暗物质和-mond-可能都预测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b19f96d3fdc2b6b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">15:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>银河系外缘转慢了，暗物质和 MOND 可能都预测错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盖亚测出的银河系外缘旋转曲线像开普勒式下降，而暗物质晕和 MOND 都预期它保持平坦——两边都得靠调参数或外部场效应才能活下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天体物理</span><span class=\"tag\">暗物质</span>\n</div></div></a>"]